ris_Sanctuary_=E2=80=93_Details_requested_=2D_regarding?=", "category": "Human Injury", "icon_type": "human_injury", "incident_date": "01/08/2026", "reported_date": "Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:18:35 +0530", "location_name": "Dindigul Forest Division", "location_key": "dindigul", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Dindigul Forest Division)", "latitude": 10.3428, "longitude": 78.0083, "pdf_attached": true, "pdf_filenames": ["Kadavur Slender Loris- Maps - Sending - Reg.pdf", "CROP DAMAGE AND CONFLICT.pdf", "FIRE VULNERABILITY.pdf", "FIRE WATCH TOWER.pdf"], "body_snippet": "Sir/Madam,\n\nPlease download the attachment.\n\nGeomatics Centre,\nO/o.Principal Chief Conservator of Forests,\n(HoFF), Velacherry,\nChennai", "pdf_snippet": "HOTNFD/2283/2025-GIS1 I/826440/2026\nRef. No. HOTNFD/2283/2025-GIS1 Office of the Principal Chief\nConservator of Forests (Head of Forest\nForce),\nState Forest Headquarters,\nGuindy, Chennai- 600032\nDated:31-07-2026\nSub: Forest – Preparation of Management Plan for Kadavur Slender Loris Sanctuary –\nDetails requested - regarding\nRef: 1. The District Forest Officer, Dindigul Forest Division, C.No.4929/2022/D1 (2),\nDated:18.06.2026.\n2. The District Forest Officer, Karur Forest Division, C.No.1615/2022/D", "pdf_path": "pdfs/REP-065_Kadavur Slender Loris- Maps - Sending - Reg.pdf", "pdf_filename": "Kadavur Slender Loris- Maps - Sending - Reg.pdf"}, {"id": "REP-072", "subject": "Elephant death Pollachi", "category": "Animal Death", "icon_type": "animal_death", "incident_date": "23/07/2026", "reported_date": "Recently Imported from Downloads", "location_name": "Coimbatore Division", "location_key": "coimbatore", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Coimbatore Division)", "latitude": 11.0368, "longitude": 76.9558, "pdf_attached": false, "pdf_filenames": ["Elephant death Pollachi.pdf"], "body_snippet": "HOTNFD/6146/2026-WLA - JA 2 I/811865/2026\nTAMILNADU FOREST DEPARTMENT\nFrom To\nTh