coimbatore", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Coimbatore Division)", "latitude": 10.9853, "longitude": 76.9383, "pdf_attached": true, "pdf_filenames": ["Amrita University - ForestGuard.pdf"], "body_snippet": "============ Forwarded message ============\nFrom: Bagavathi C - [CSE] <c_bagavathi@cb.amrita.edu>\nTo: \"tnforest@nic.in\"<tnforest@nic.in>\nCc: \"baranidharan.k@tnau.ac.in\"<baranidharan.k@tnau.ac.in>, \"Dr. Senthilkumar M (CSE)\"<m_senthil@cb.amrita.edu>, \"Uma J - [CSE]\"<j_uma@cb.amrita.edu>\nDate: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 13:30:53 +0530\nSubject: Tamil Nadu Forest Department - Proposal submission.\n============ Forwarded message ============\n\n\n\nDear sir.\n\n            As a group of researchers working in the are", "pdf_snippet": "Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham— ForestGuard | Tamil Nadu Forest Department - Innovative Project Proposal\n2026\nINNOVATIVE PROJECT PROPOSAL\nSubmitted by\nDr. M Senthilkumar, Professor, Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Coimbatore\nDr. K. Baranidharan, Professor, TNAU Forest College & Research Institute, Coimbatore\nDr C Bagavathi, Assistant Professor, Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Coimbatore\nDr J Uma, Assistant Professor, Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham, Coimbatore\nForestGuard: AI-Enabled Multi-Scale Forest\nDisturban", "pdf_path": "pdfs/REP-059_Amrita University - ForestGuard.pdf", "pdf_filename": "Amrita University - ForestGuard.pdf"}, {"id": "REP-074", "subject": "Elephant death _ Sathy", "category": "Animal Death", "icon_type": "animal_death", "incident_date": "13/07/2026", "reported_date": "Recently Imported from Downloads", "location_name": "Sathyamangalam Division", "location_key": "sathyamangalam", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Sathyamangalam Division)", "latitude": 11.5039, "longitude": 77.2524, "pdf_attached": false, "pdf_filenames": ["Elephant death _ Sathy.pdf"], "body_snippet": "HOTNFD/5750/2026-WLA - JA 2 I/792951/2026\nTAMILNADU FOREST DEPARTMENT\nFrom T