 Environment, Climate Change and\nHead Quarters, Forest Department,\nVelachery", "pdf_snippet": "", "pdf_path": null, "pdf_filename": null}, {"id": "REP-054", "mbox_id": 53, "subject": "Human death on 28.04.2026 in Coimbatore - Reg", "category": "Human Death", "icon_type": "human_death", "incident_date": "28/04/2026", "reported_date": "Thu, 30 Apr 2026 04:57:38 +0000 (UTC)", "location_name": "Coimbatore Division", "location_key": "coimbatore", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Coimbatore Division)", "latitude": 10.9928, "longitude": 76.9858, "pdf_attached": true, "pdf_filenames": ["document (80).pdf"], "body_snippet": "Sir/Madam,\nPlease find the attachments. \n\n\nWildlife Wing,\nO/o. the Principal Chief Conservator of Forests (Head of Forests Force),Guindy - Velachery Main Road,Chennai-32.", "pdf_snippet": "HOTNFD/3922/2026-WLA - JA 2 I/667007/2026\nத(cid:2)(cid:3)நா(cid:6) வன(cid:10)(cid:11)ைற\nஅ(cid:15)(cid:16)(cid:17)ந(cid:18) ெப(cid:21)ந(cid:18)\n(cid:22)(cid:23). (cid:25)(cid:26)வா(cid:27) ரா. ெர(cid:29)(cid:30), இ.வ.ப., அர(cid:56) (cid:45)(cid:6)த(cid:57) தைலைம ெசயலாள(cid:18),\n(cid:33)த(cid:34)ைம தைலைம வன(cid:16)பா(cid:11)காவல(cid:18) (ம) (cid:56)(cid:58)(cid:21)(cid:59)(cid:60)ழ(cid:57), கால(cid:62)ைல மா(cid:58)ற(cid:47)\nதைலைம வன உ(cid:41)(cid:42)ன(cid:43)கா(cid:16)பாள(cid:18), ((cid:33).(cid:4", "pdf_path": "pdfs/REP-054_document (80).pdf", "pdf_filename": "document (80).pdf"}, {"id": "REP-005", "mbox_id": 61, "subject": "Fwd: Forests - Wild Life - Male elephant death on 26.04.2026 in Nilgiris Division - Reg.", "category": "Animal Death", "icon_type": "animal_death", "incident_date": "26/04/2026", "reported_date": "Recently Received", "location_name": "Nilgiris Division", "location_key": "nilgiris", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Nilgiris Division)", "latitude": 11.3892, "longitude": 76.674, "pdf_attached": true, "pdf_filenames": ["Male Elephant death on 26.04.2026 in Nilgiris.pdf"], "body_snippet": "Official Flash Report received regarding Fwd: Forests - Wild Life - Male elephant death on 26.04.2026 in Nilgiris Division - Reg. in Nilgiris Division.", "pdf_snippet": "Attached PDF report details for Fwd: Forests - Wild Life - Male elephant death on 26.04.2026 in Nilgiris Division - Reg..", "pdf_path": "pdfs/REP-005_WL1-5648-2025 dt. 01.01.2026.pdf", "pdf_filename": "WL1-5648-2025 dt. 01.01.2026.pdf"}, {"id": "REP-046", "mbox_id": 45, "subject": "Human Death on 25.04.2026 at Gudalur - Reg", "category": "Human Death", "icon_type": "human_death", "incident_date": "25/04/2026", "reported_date": "Tue, 28 Apr 2026 11:29:03 +0000 (UTC)", "location_name": "Gudalur Forest Division", "location_key": "gudalur", "has_exact_coords": true, "coord_source": "Exact PDF GPS Coordinate (Partial Refined)", "latitude": 11.436573, "longitude": 76.4952, "pdf_attached": true, "pdf_filenames": ["document (81).pdf"], "body_snippet": "Sir/Madam,\nPlease find the attachments. \n\n\nWildlife Wing,\nO/o. the Principal Chief Conservator of Forests (Head of Forests Force),Guindy - Velachery Main Road,Chennai-32.", "pdf_snippet": "HOTNFD/3863/2026-WLA - JA 2 I/664495/2026\nத(cid:2)(cid:3)நா(cid:6)வன(cid:9)(cid:10)ைற\nஅ(cid:15)(cid:16)(cid:17)ந(cid:18) ெப(cid:21)ந(cid:18)\n(cid:22)(cid:23). (cid:25)(cid:26)வா(cid:27) ரா. ெர(cid:29)(cid:30), இ.வ.ப., அர(cid:56)(cid:45)(cid:6)த(cid:57)தைலைமெசயலாள(cid:18),\n(cid:33)த(cid:34)ைமதைலைமவன(cid:16)பா(cid:10)காவல(cid:18) (ம) (cid:56)(cid:58)(cid:21)(cid:59)(cid:60)ழ(cid:57), கால(cid:26)ைல மா(cid:58)ற(cid:47)\nதைலைமவன உ(cid:41)(cid:42)ன(cid:43)கா(cid:16)பாள(cid:18), ((cid:33).(cid:45).ெபா) ", "pdf_path": "pdfs/REP-046_document (81).pdf", "pdf_filename": "document (81).pdf"}, {"id": "REP-047", "mbox_id": 46, "subject": "Reg : Flash Reports Workflow Modified and Changes Completed | TNFD\n End to End portal", "category": "Human Injury", "icon_type": "human_injury", "incident_date": "20/04/2026", "reported_date": "Tue, 12 May 2026 13:07:19 +0530", "location_name": "Nilgiris Division", "location_key": "nilgiri", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Nilgiris Division)", "latitude": 11.4207, "longitude": 76.688, "pdf_attached": true, "pdf_filenames": ["TNFD - End to End portal  - Workflow for Flash\n reports.pdf"], "body_snippet": "Dear Sir,\n\n\n\n\n\nAs per the meeting held with CCF Wildlife and the Wildlife Section, we have modified the workflow of the “Flash Reports” module in the TNFD End-to-End Portal and deployed the updated changes to the production environment.\n\nPlease find the attached updated workflow document for your reference.\n\n\n\nKindly intimate the Wildlife Section, Division, and Range users to commence usage of the Flash Reports module.\n\n\n\nThanks and Regards\n\nGopalakrishnan\n\nmailto:tech.g@in22labs.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "pdf_snippet": "Flash Reports Workflow changes\nWe need to do the following changes in flash reports\nForm Changes:\n1. Need to add a new field “Inside / Outside RF”\n2. If user choose inside RF, then we need to collect “Reserve Forest Name”\nHuman Injury / Death:\n1. In Human death and injury we need to follow the below work flow\nFRO – Data entry and submit, system will forward that to DFO. DFO will get notification.\nDFO – After DFO approval, Flash report will be sent to\na. PCCF HOFF – by mail and portal notificatio", "pdf_path": "pdfs/REP-047_TNFD - End to End portal  - Workflow for Flash  reports.pdf", "pdf_filename": "TNFD - End to End portal  - Workflow for Flash  reports.pdf"}, {"id": "REP-032", "mbox_id": 29, "subject": "Human Death on 19.04.2026 at Pollachi - Reg", "category": "Human Death", "icon_type": "human_death", "incident_date": "19/04/2026", "reported_date": "Mon, 20 Apr 2026 12:17:57 +0000 (UTC)", "location_name": "Pollachi Forest Division", "location_key": "pollachi", "has_exact_coords": false, "coord_source": "Central Location Fallback (Pollachi Forest Division)", "latitude": 10.6203, "longitude": 